Cell["\<\
i is an integer from 0 through 8. Index 0 returns the 3 by 3 identity; \
indices 1 through 8 return the conventional traceless generators.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->583897083,ExpressionUUID->"c9313397-997d-5745-b7a8-c6c590f635a4"],

Cell["\<\
The function is Listable and returns SparseArray matrices. The generators use \
Tr[lambda_i . lambda_j] = 2 delta_ij for indices 1 through 8.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->920541429,ExpressionUUID->"29cbbba7-cc3d-7242-a551-a78e27ae367b"]
}, Closed]],

